WEBVTT

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:02.900
The Digital World,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.090
a world inhabited by unusual 
creatures called Digimon.

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:09.950
It has been conquered 
by the evil Bagra Army

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.520
and divided into seven Kingdoms 
ruled by seven Death Generals.

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:18.310
Taiki Kudou has leapt 
into these seven Kingdoms

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:22.030
along with his partner, 
Shoutmon, to save the Digimon.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.680
This is the story of the 
friendship and adventures

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:28.540
shared by Taiki, his friends, 
and the Digimon.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:57.860
Yuu...

00:01:57.860 --> 00:02:01.820
<i>The one I saw when I was fighting 
in the Honey Land forest.</i>

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:03.630
<i>A kid with blond hair.</i>

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:07.010
<i>Could it be... Yuu's in this Kingdom?</i>

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:12.090
We managed to open the 
path to the next Kingdom,

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:13.580
and we have to put it off...

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:18.530
You idiot! We might find 
Nene's little brother!

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:21.820
Saving him here would show 
our spirit of friendship!

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:25.220
Oh, you're right! 
Just like you, Brother!

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:28.930
It might be that Yuu is being 
manipulated by the enemy.

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:30.760
Kiriha was manipulated by

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:33.100
DarkKnightmon before, too, remember?

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:36.000
I wonder.

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:40.480
Incoming message from 
Revolmon's search party!

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:42.370
Taiki! I found him!

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:52.600
<b>Why, Brother, Why?!</b>

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:52.600
<b>The Enemy General Yuu's Nightmare</b>

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:50.170
Why, Brother, Why?! 
The Enemy General Yuu's Nightmare!

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:59.420
It's a blond boy.

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:01.420
It's probably Yuu.

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:02.460
We have to help him, quick!

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:05.960
You okay?

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:09.860
Hang on!

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:11.740
I'm scared... I'm scared...

00:03:11.740 --> 00:03:14.010
Thank you.

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:19.380
You fell for it.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:20.790
No good letting your guard down!

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:25.980
Why?!

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:29.750
Relax. For now, you two are hostages.

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:31.860
Nene, is that...

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:33.970
Is that... Yuu?

00:03:33.970 --> 00:03:35.060
What is he...

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:42.300
Hey!

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:43.570
Yuu!

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:45.340
Sis!

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:47.460
What's going on? What happened?

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.540
He deceived us!

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:51.280
We almost fell into his trap!

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:54.050
Careful! I've got a 
bad feeling about him!

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:57.650
Yuu...

00:03:57.650 --> 00:04:00.100
Digi Ninja Art: Warrior Transformation!

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:06.560
Y-You're that...

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:09.360
<i>Ten shots cleared. 
Your training is complete.</i>

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:11.860
<i>Blastmon will be here soon.</i>

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:13.900
<i>Defeat him.</i>

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.900
Correct. I am Tuwarmon,

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:19.310
Lord DarkKnightmon's 
number one subordinate

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:21.810
and Master Yuu's bodyguard.

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:23.000
Tuwarmon?

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:26.700
Why did a guy like you help me train?!

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:27.610
He helped you?

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:30.930
It's what they call internal conflict.

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:33.320
Tuwarmon, use Smokin' Boogie!

00:04:33.320 --> 00:04:33.890
With pleasure!

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:35.720
Smokin' Boogie!

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:39.890
A smoke screen!

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:43.150
Wait, Yuu!

00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:44.630
Don't go with him!

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:49.720
But if my sister catches me, 
it's game over, Taiki.

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:53.300
And then I wouldn't 
be able to fight you.

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:55.190
Yuu!

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:56.210
Miss Nene!

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:58.710
Wait, Nene! Don't go alone!

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:01.610
Mantis Arm!

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:02.850
Nene!

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:10.430
Nene! Wait! Yuu's...

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:13.130
Looks like you also sensed it, Taiki.

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:14.790
Yuu is...

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.240
Nene is in danger!

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:18.380
Sparrowmon, go after her, quick!

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.360
Right!

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:22.300
Beelzebumon, I need you to 
carry us to the other side!

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:22.770
Right!

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.780
I feel it... I can feel it...

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:35.170
The power of the negative energy 
pouring into my Code Crown.

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:39.250
Lord Bagramon, at last we meet again.

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:42.920
Ah, Lilithmon. 
Did you enjoy your vacation?

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:46.860
Not at all. In fact, 
it was quite irritating,

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:49.430
being unable to help you.

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:51.880
You are conscientious.

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:54.130
Then you should be pleased to hear that

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:56.580
you will be returning to work today.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:58.450
Really?!

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:01.380
Yes. Give it your utmost effort.

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:05.090
For the sake of D5, 
the Day of Ultimate Destruction.

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:08.350
Huh? D... what?

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:11.180
You will know soon enough.

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:14.540
I truly look forward to 
seeing what you can do.

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:18.220
Thank you! I'm so happy!

00:06:18.220 --> 00:06:21.950
I'm jealous! He really has 
high hopes for you, Lili!

00:06:21.950 --> 00:06:23.770
Take us with you!

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:24.960
Please!

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:27.570
Certainly not.

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:31.350
If I take you, my sense in 
companionship will be questioned.

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:36.240
I'm going to become the ruler 
of a Kingdom, a Death General!

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:39.510
Now, to which Kingdom 
have I been assigned?

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:43.350
Hm? This looks familiar somehow...

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:46.590
Our team does not belong to any Kingdom.

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:50.700
It is my duty to preside 
over the seven Kingdoms

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:52.260
in my brother's stead.

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:54.300
DarkKnightmon?!

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:57.900
You are now under the direct 
supervision of myself, the Admiral.

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:00.560
I am assigning your 
first task immediately.

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:04.270
You will fight on hell's 
battlefield, Lilithmon.

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:05.640
What?!

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:09.860
How cruel, being demoted from 
a ruler to a common soldier.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:13.280
I think I'll go home 
and watch some TV...

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:16.650
This?

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:17.760
Indeed.

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:20.940
In each of the Seven Kingdoms, 
there are a few places like this

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:24.610
where my subordinate 
Digimon are sealed away,

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:29.340
so that they can fight for Lord 
DarkKnightmon if the need arises.

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:32.570
Lucky us! We found something 
that's gonna turn the tables!

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:36.630
I don't have sufficient forces 
to fight Taiki right now.

00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:38.160
Once this Digimon moves,

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:41.470
Lord DarkKnightmon will 
know our current location.

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:43.540
Digi Ninja Art: Hermit Restoration!

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:52.680
Kimon Tonkou.

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:15.220
What's going on?

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:25.120
What is this place?

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:33.260
It can't be!

00:08:36.020 --> 00:08:37.530
The human world?

00:08:49.740 --> 00:08:52.880
What is this? An illusion?

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:57.850
It must be. After all, this town is...

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:00.450
The town where we were born and raised.

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:08.240
Yuu!

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.810
Long time no see, Sis.

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:22.640
Yuu...

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:26.390
You're being manipulated by 
DarkKnightmon, aren't you?

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:28.980
So he can use the Darkness Loader?

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:35.350
I thought you were more the 
brainy type of player.

00:09:35.910 --> 00:09:37.990
You're worse at reading 
into things than I thought.

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:45.930
I've got her, Master Yuu.

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:47.820
Good work, Doumon.

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:49.600
Tuwarmon!

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:50.500
I am here.

00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:56.620
Yuu, what is the meaning of this?

00:09:56.620 --> 00:10:00.960
Sis, I'm not being manipulated.

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:02.880
I'm fighting of my own free will,

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:06.240
in this game for control 
of the Digital World.

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:07.320
Game?

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:14.300
Sparrowmon should be around here.

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:15.760
Taiki!

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:18.300
Sparrowmon!

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:19.630
Are you okay?

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:22.300
Taiki, Nene's disappeared!

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.940
Game? What are you saying, Yuu?

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:27.610
Oh, come on. Don't play dumb.

00:10:27.610 --> 00:10:30.820
Aren't Digimon battles fun?

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:34.310
It's so exciting to watch 
data fighting one another.

00:10:34.310 --> 00:10:35.810
It's the best game ever.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:40.280
I can't quit until I become the 
final victor of the Digital World.

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:41.980
Yuu...

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:45.760
No, Yuu. We're going back.

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:48.160
You and I are going back 
to the human world!

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:49.450
I don't want to.

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:52.780
You can try to make me stop, 
but I won't fall for that.

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:55.320
I won't let my data be erased.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:58.330
Go back home by yourself.

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:01.000
I'll have your data erased now.

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:01.850
Tuwarmon!

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:02.540
With pleasure.

00:11:05.650 --> 00:11:06.830
No...

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:09.300
Yuu! You're wrong!

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:11.980
You and I are not data!

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:15.550
Everything in the Digital 
World is made of data.

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:19.460
Including the players. 
DarkKnightmon told me so.

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:24.700
Too bad for you, Sis.

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:25.580
Goodbye.

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:27.610
Yuu...

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:33.370
What happened to the quiet, 
wimpy Yuu I once knew?

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:38.760
<i>Wow! You're good at this, Yuu!</i>

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:51.090
Butterfly's Grave

00:11:57.850 --> 00:11:59.130
<i>I hate it.</i>

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:04.070
<i>I hate it when things die.</i>

00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:08.240
<i>Yuu...</i>

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:12.960
<i>Aren't you going to play, Yuu?</i>

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:13.770
<i>No.</i>

00:12:13.770 --> 00:12:15.390
<i>Who cares if you lose?</i>

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:19.650
<i>I'd just feel bad if I hurt someone.</i>

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:22.390
<i>Just kidding!</i>

00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:25.320
<i>Honestly, Yuu...</i>

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:30.350
<i>What's that?</i>

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:37.020
<i>Where are we?</i>

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:39.650
<i>Sis, I'm scared...</i>

00:12:57.160 --> 00:12:58.030
<i>Yuu!</i>

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:03.540
<i>Yuu...</i>

00:13:08.630 --> 00:13:10.230
<i>That's right...</i>

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:12.980
<i>When that happened, Yuu...</i>

00:13:13.570 --> 00:13:16.050
<i>smiled in a way that 
he never had before...</i>

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:20.370
It can't be...

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:21.810
Yuu couldn't be...

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:22.850
Prepare yourself!

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:25.420
<i>Yuu!</i>

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:26.950
This is it.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:30.080
Beyond this point is a closed 
artificial realm created

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:32.090
by a special Digital power.

00:13:32.090 --> 00:13:33.480
What does that mean?

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:35.610
It's the magic of an evil Digimon.

00:13:35.610 --> 00:13:37.460
Something like an invisible box.

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:39.090
How can we break through it?

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:43.340
If we blast a hole in it with concentrated 
high energy, it may perhaps...

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:44.310
Out of the way!

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:50.980
Mervamon!

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:52.840
I won't let you hurt Nene!

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:56.650
You were inside my Xros Loader?!

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:03.120
I was worried about you, 
so I hid in there.

00:14:10.190 --> 00:14:12.780
This one uses some shady techniques.

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:17.340
Aw, man...

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.090
MetalGreymon!

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:28.300
We've been found.

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:29.050
Regrettable.

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:30.280
Nene!

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:31.660
Sparrowmon!

00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:35.190
Kiriha! Taiki!

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:40.170
Jeez... Why are you always so 
reckless when Nene is involved?

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:43.300
We certainly are in a bind.

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:44.560
What shall we do?

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:46.980
So Yuu's been acting 
of his own free will.

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:50.000
Those are the eyes of someone 
who enjoys fighting.

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:52.000
You both knew?

00:14:52.520 --> 00:14:55.440
He wasn't acting the way Kiriha did

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:56.310
when DarkKnightmon brainwashed him.

00:14:56.780 --> 00:15:00.260
I knew right away that he 
wasn't being manipulated.

00:15:00.260 --> 00:15:03.550
I... still can't believe it.

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:05.260
I don't want to believe it.

00:15:05.260 --> 00:15:07.240
Accept it, Nene.

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:08.670
This is reality.

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:11.120
Super-dimensional Axe!

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:17.130
We meet again.

00:15:17.130 --> 00:15:18.460
DarkKnightmon!

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:21.880
All right! Now we can come out on top!

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:25.060
I have prepared new pieces for our game.

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:27.470
Use them as you like, Yuu.

00:15:31.350 --> 00:15:32.980
This'll be fun!

00:15:32.980 --> 00:15:35.510
Lilithmon! Blastmon! Evilmons!

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:37.220
DigiXros!

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:42.360
What?! Ridonkulous!

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:50.260
No! What is this?!

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:53.350
My aesthetic sense will 
not stand for this!

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:55.410
This might have its perks!

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:57.400
I feel I'm being treated 
somewhat crudely here.

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:58.330
And now...

00:15:58.330 --> 00:16:00.470
DarkKnightmon, Xros Open!

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.280
Tuwarmon! DeadlyAxemon!

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:06.740
Time to DigiXros!

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:13.910
DeadlyTuwarmon!

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:15.290
Giga Destroyer!

00:16:22.490 --> 00:16:23.900
Impressive.

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:28.200
It seems you do have 
natural talent, Yuu.

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:35.640
DigiXros!

00:16:36.130 --> 00:16:39.740
Shoutmon X5B!

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:42.880
Back up MetalGreymon, X5B!

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:43.400
Right!

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:47.490
Why, you!

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:49.450
Whoa!

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:52.040
Xros Open!

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:55.460
I'm going to explode!

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:57.760
I'm ridin' spinners!

00:16:57.760 --> 00:16:59.350
Wh-What's that?

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:01.170
They're spinning like a top!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.290
We're going to go full force!

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:07.710
Doumon!

00:17:08.220 --> 00:17:08.940
Sir!

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:12.610
Use your full power and 
distort their senses!

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:13.440
Understood!

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:15.950
And the final blow will be struck by...

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:17.620
you two!

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:21.120
Wonderful. I am impressed, Yuu.

00:17:23.590 --> 00:17:27.090
Kimon Tonkou: Genwakujin.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:30.230
What's happening?

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:39.130
Well, well.

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:41.220
Looks like things are 
getting interesting now.

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:43.920
I can't see the enemy!

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:46.410
Where are you aiming?

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:49.110
I'm right here!

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:50.720
And I'm right here!

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:52.020
What's going on?

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:53.620
It's the enemy's technique!

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:54.450
Wisemon!

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:57.610
The Digimon controlling this 
space is here somewhere.

00:17:57.610 --> 00:18:00.530
Unless you find him, you cannot win.

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:02.890
DarkKnightmon! Tuwarmon!

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:04.130
DigiXros!

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:09.970
MusoKnightmon!

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:13.660
Raise your energy to the max and 
blast them until nothing remains!

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:14.570
Understood.

00:18:20.060 --> 00:18:22.350
What can I do?

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:25.450
Stop him even if you 
have to do it yourself.

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:30.400
That's what you told me when 
I saved my own brother.

00:18:30.930 --> 00:18:32.660
Stop him by force if you have to.

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:34.750
Mervamon...

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:37.920
Thanks.

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:39.030
Nene!

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:40.060
Help us!

00:18:40.410 --> 00:18:41.250
Nene,

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:45.900
DigiXros Hi-VisionMonitamon and 
me into a sword for Mervamon.

00:18:46.380 --> 00:18:49.870
With her intuition and 
our investigative powers...

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:51.980
All right.

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:55.010
Mervamon!

00:18:56.380 --> 00:18:57.940
Wisemon!

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:00.750
Hi-VisionMonitamon!

00:19:01.590 --> 00:19:03.220
DigiXros!

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:04.820
DigiXros!

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:08.930
Mervamon Wide Hi-Vision Sword!

00:19:08.930 --> 00:19:10.490
Feel it!

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:12.300
Follow your intuition!

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:13.200
Got it!

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:17.930
There!

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:24.540
I see it!

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:26.980
Sharp!

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:28.510
That really hurts!

00:19:28.510 --> 00:19:29.450
What?

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:33.050
We were so close!

00:19:33.050 --> 00:19:35.290
Nene and her Digimon pulled it off!

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:38.460
We're not men if we don't heat up now!

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:41.430
Digivolve!

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:43.390
Shoutmon!

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:45.530
MetalGreymon!

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:47.130
Digivolve!

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:49.480
OmegaShoutmon!

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:52.340
ZekeGreymon!

00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:58.280
Super Powered Rumbling Breaker!

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:29.610
Shoutmon!

00:20:30.650 --> 00:20:31.910
Shoutmon!

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:33.780
Shoutmon!

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:37.200
Thank goodness, you're awake!

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:38.690
What happened to them?

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:39.970
I don't know.

00:20:39.970 --> 00:20:41.950
They've disappeared somewhere.

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:43.350
We're right here.

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:47.420
My objective today was to rescue Yuu.

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:51.330
I will be retreating for now.

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:52.760
To rescue Yuu?

00:20:52.760 --> 00:20:55.300
When you defeat a Death General,

00:20:55.300 --> 00:20:58.640
you become the only ones who can 
enter or leave that Kingdom.

00:20:58.640 --> 00:21:02.130
Yuu just happened to be in Honey Land.

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:04.380
He was unable to leave.

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:08.340
Fighting Taiki and his team was 
fun, like I knew it would be!

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:08.810
Yuu!

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:11.330
Next time I'll definitely defeat you.

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.480
With my most powerful fighting force.

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:17.000
Yuu, Digimon aren't just data!

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:18.960
They're alive! Yuu!

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:24.450
Yuu!

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:31.140
Nene.

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:36.720
I will catch Yuu, no matter what.

00:21:37.130 --> 00:21:38.350
And then...

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:40.550
And then?

00:21:40.550 --> 00:21:42.850
You'll stop him even if you 
have to do it yourself, right?

00:21:42.850 --> 00:21:43.900
Yes.

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:47.020
I'll continue to help you out, Nene.

00:21:47.020 --> 00:21:49.160
Let's bust through this together!

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:50.820
Yeah, we sure will!

00:21:52.180 --> 00:21:54.980
That's one fearsome new combo!

00:21:57.010 --> 00:21:58.460
<i>I'll stop you...</i>

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:03.270
<i>because you're my 
precious little brother, Yuu.</i>

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:09.760
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:13.280
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:22:10.540 --> 00:22:13.280
Digimon Data Collection!

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:17.220
<b>Listen to the Digimon's melody!</b>

00:22:13.860 --> 00:22:17.220
Listen to the melody of 
this Digimon I caught!

00:22:14.230 --> 00:22:15.230
<b>Melody starts in 3 seconds.</b>

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:16.230
<b>Melody starts in 2 seconds.</b>

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:17.220
<b>Melody starts in 1 second.</b>

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:34.270
<b>[Type]</b>

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:27.090
<b>Demon Man Type</b>

00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:34.270
<b>[Attack]</b>

00:22:25.020 --> 00:22:39.640
<b>Bonhitsusen</b>

00:22:27.090 --> 00:22:39.640
<b>Demon</b>

00:22:27.190 --> 00:22:28.160
Taomon.

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:29.990
His special attack is Bonhitsusen,

00:22:29.990 --> 00:22:32.550
in which he writes a character 
in the air with a giant brush.

00:22:32.550 --> 00:22:34.680
His incantations are very powerful!

00:22:34.680 --> 00:22:36.750
Please give me an autograph 
with that brush!

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:39.640
You'll get hit with an attack!

00:22:41.020 --> 00:22:43.940
The fourth Kingdom is a 
strange, futuristic city.

00:22:43.940 --> 00:22:46.810
This is weird. I don't see 
the Death General anywhere!

00:22:46.810 --> 00:22:49.380
I'm Ruka! Take me with you!

00:22:49.380 --> 00:22:50.930
A human girl?!

00:22:51.520 --> 00:22:52.650
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:22:52.650 --> 00:22:54.470
<b>The Mysterious Cyber Land!</b>

00:22:52.650 --> 00:22:54.470
<b>The Girl of the Steel City</b>

00:22:52.650 --> 00:22:54.520
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
